\begin{center}
\begin{tabular}{lll}
\hline
Policy & Barrier keeps & Why the example survives \\
\hline
Insertion & New target & Discovers \(W\) during insertion \\
Snapshot at start & Replaced target & Records \(W\) during deletion \\
